stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Scraping: Query starts
    
    Scraping --> Scraped: Links collected
    
    Scraped --> DirectPending: Initialize status.json
    
    DirectPending --> DirectInProgress: Worker picks up
    DirectInProgress --> DirectCompleted: Downloads done
    DirectInProgress --> DirectFailed: Error
    
    DirectCompleted --> ArchivePending: Check for archive links
    DirectFailed --> ArchivePending: Continue anyway
    
    ArchivePending --> ArchiveInProgress: Archive worker picks up
    ArchiveInProgress --> ArchiveCompleted: Archive downloads done
    ArchiveInProgress --> ArchiveFailed: Error
    
    ArchiveCompleted --> SplitPending: Both downloads done
    ArchiveFailed --> SplitPending: Continue anyway
    
    SplitPending --> SplitInProgress: Split service picks up
    SplitInProgress --> SplitCompleted: Batching done
    SplitInProgress --> SplitFailed: Error
    
    SplitCompleted --> [*]: Query complete
    
    note right of Scraping
        Scraper Service writes:
        - links_count
        - scraped_at
        - Initializes all stages to "pending"
    end note
    
    note right of DirectInProgress
        Direct Worker owns:
        - direct_download_status
        - direct_download_count
    end note
    
    note right of ArchiveInProgress
        Archive Worker owns:
        - archive_download_status
        - archive_download_count
    end note
    
    note right of SplitInProgress
        Split Service owns:
        - split_status
        - split_summary
    end note

